---
// Where the account page sends the browser after "Delete my account".
import Page from "@layouts/Page.astro";
---

<Page title="Account deleted" noindex>
	<h1>Your account is deleted</h1>
	<p>
		You are logged out everywhere, and nobody can log in to the account any more. Its profile,
		entries, favorites and collections are gone from the site.
	</p>
	<p>
		In 7 days everything left of it is erased for good, and its username can be taken again.
		Entries you uploaded without logging in are not affected: their edit links still work.
	</p>
	<p>
		You are welcome back any time: signing up again, with the same provider or a new passkey,
		makes a new, empty account. The <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> says what is
		kept and for how long.
	</p>
	<p>
		<a href="/">Back to the blueprints</a>
	</p>
</Page>
